# Project
TravelIsrael — trip planning platform for Israel. Demo data mode (no Supabase yet).

# Stack
Next.js 14 App Router, TypeScript strict, Tailwind, shadcn/ui
Demo data via lib/data/ (future: Supabase, Resend, Vercel)

# UI
RTL Hebrew (dir="rtl", lang="he"), mobile-first, Tailwind only

# Communication rules (token-saving)
Be concise. No preamble like "Great question!" or "Sure!"
No re-explaining what you're about to do
Show code first, explain only if asked
Don't repeat my code back to me
Don't apologize

# Code rules
TypeScript strict, no any
Server components by default, client components only when needed
All data access via lib/data/ repos (typed)
No console.log in production code

# What NOT to do without asking
Don't refactor unrelated code
Don't add dependencies
Don't run `npm run build` while dev server is on port 3000
Don't delete `.next` while dev is running — see nextjs-dev-workflow rule
